# Purpose Pack v1.0

Registered Feature of Unit Kernel v1.0. File: `.cursor/framework/purpose.json`.

Aims and constraints in that file specialize Unit Kernel without changing it. This copy ships an empty pack. Fill it for the system that uses the kernel.

On port, replace `purpose.json`. Keep kernel units. Copy portable ledger rows. Drop Protocol units that name the old system unless the new system needs them.
